OL,3,GNEWSAAward for boy who steered car to
OL,4,Asafety at 60mph
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose life was saved by her
OL,7,Fson's quick thinking after she
OL,8,Fcollapsed at the wheel said she is
OL,9,F"incredibly proud" after he won a
OL,10,Fnational bravery award.
OL,12,FThirteen-year-old Zac, from Ebbw Vale
OL,13,Fin Blaenau Gwent, received the Child of
OL,14,FCourage award at the Pride of Britain
OL,15,FAwards after steering his mum's car to
OL,16,Fsafety while travelling at 60mph on the
OL,17,FA40 in Herefordshire.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
