OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAward for boy who steered car to
OL,4,Asafety at 60mph
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Nicola fainted Zac grabbed the
OL,7,Fsteering wheel, guiding the car into
OL,8,Fthe central reservation before
OL,9,Fswitching off the engine and calling
OL,10,F999.
OL,12,FNicola, said: "I was proud of him
OL,13,Fanyway but what he did for me that day
OL,14,Fwas just absolutely amazing. If he
OL,15,Fwasn't there that day I don't think I'd
OL,16,Fbe here now."
